name:"Multiband Depression"

author:"Tenchio"

[00:44.70] Mr. Sun, will you move aside?
[00:46.57] The clouds are better to face the outside
[00:48.73] And I'd like to face it, give an attempt
[00:51.36] Step into summer before you reset
[00:53.26] No such thing as movement
[00:56.41] Falls straight through my consciousness
[00:59.09] There's no such thing as movement
[01:02.83] Control will escape my hands
[01:31.92] When will you leave?
[01:38.37] When will you leave?
[01:45.52] When will you leave?
[01:48.73] Can I leave first?
[01:52.14] Unwanted warmth just melts me every time
[01:56.73] I can't breathe
[02:44.09] Mr. Sun, can you hear them screaming?
[02:47.39] Every cycle, hope for the same thing
[02:50.59] Mr. Sun, can you hear them screaming?
[02:53.76] Every cycle, hope for the same thing yet again
[02:59.76] 
